cb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nVJj97_zfg8Q7kNvwFvvxmd&_nc_oc=Ado_VgXTgr5nNgVTftTcPbylboOhiYJQB05tGLpbtLZEfTfU2Awjk8Aa6_7HyDdxmbI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXmty-JVSeqCEnA3HQaR_pqcP0A3_qdaa7os4M_KEhWyw&oe=6B0F1EEA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SBS-1.png", "id": "1889401618406419", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618444_1889401621739752_8904061124924124698_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tSAC7OI3u6EQ7kNvwG5fSkx&_nc_oc=AdqJq4DC6pz3ah1dUkf6Sj4leJX_Ss9Z7hfp3p8UjZ92yLXS1iq13dfkTjb8537tHDo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWno6R2jYf2XE_xApwpY4bzeU5FD2nC_YvbS7jrFAzQNw&oe=6B0F19FD"}, "display_name": "Subspace Battle Simulator", "keywords": ["battlesimulator", "bs", "simulator", "subspace"], "long_description": "Step into the ultimate battlefield with Subspace Battle Simulator: VR Edition! Immerse yourself in chaotic, cartoon-style warfare as you command epic armies across stunning virtual battlefields. Take direct control of legendary warriors, fearsome dragons, and powerful mages, or orchestrate large-scale battles from a god's-eye view. With intuitive VR controls, you'll dodge arrows, cast devastating spells, and lead your troops to victory in real-time. Experience hilarious ragdoll physics, dynamic environmental destruction, and endless strategic possibilities. Whether you're a casual gamer looking for laughs or a strategy enthusiast craving tactical depth, this VR adaptation delivers an unmatched combat experience. ", "short_description": "The game offers a top-down perspective and a first-person VR experience. It is played based on a sandbox simulation and PVE (Player vs. Environment) challenges. The game provides over a dozen different types of combat units, and players can freely combine and configure them to build their own most powerful army to defeat the enemies."}]}, "developer_nam